flowchart TD
    subgraph Ingestion["Ingestion Layer (ADR-005)"]
        direction TB
        Public[Public Sources<br/>• AllTrails<br/>• Reddit API<br/>• Strava Metro]
        Partner[Partner APIs<br/>• PCTA API<br/>• ATC API<br/>• CDTC API]
        Direct[Direct Submission<br/>• PWA web form<br/>• Email intake<br/>• SMS gateway]
    end

    NormalizedReport(Normalized report:<br/>text, photo URL, GPS, source metadata)

    subgraph Intake["Intake Agent (Project 1)"]
        I1[Validates GPS against RIDB trail registry]
        I2[Extracts structured data from free text]
        I3[Maps to TRACS categories]
        I4[Assigns initial confidence score]
    end

    subgraph Hazard["Hazard Classifier (Project 3)"]
        H1[Analyzes photo using Gemini Vision]
        H2[Validates hazard type against image content]
        H3[Adjusts confidence score based on visual evidence]
    end

    subgraph Triage["Triage Engine"]
        T1[Checks for duplicate/similar reports]
        T2[Weighs by trail popularity]
        T3[Weighs by hazard severity]
        T4[Assigns priority:<br/>CLOSURE / MAINTENANCE / INFO_ONLY]
    end

    subgraph Storage["Storage (BigQuery + PostGIS)"]
        S1[Raw reports (immutable audit trail)]
        S2[Triaged reports (enriched, actionable)]
        S3[Trail registry (synced from RIDB quarterly)]
        S4[Closure history (for trend analysis)]
    end

    Coordinator[Coordinator Dashboard<br/>(Project 2)]
    Ranger[Ranger Dashboard<br/>(Project 2)]
    Hiker[Hiker Alerts<br/>(Project 4)]

    Public --> NormalizedReport
    Partner --> NormalizedReport
    Direct --> NormalizedReport

    NormalizedReport --> Intake
    Intake --> Hazard
    Hazard --> Triage
    Triage --> Storage

    Storage --> Coordinator
    Storage --> Ranger
    Storage --> Hiker
